.TH NOWAYPROMPT-SSH-ASKPASS 1 2026-07-26 nowayprompt "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
nowayprompt-ssh-askpass \- SSH askpass provider
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nowayprompt-ssh-askpass
.RI [ prompt ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B nowayprompt-ssh-askpass
requests a password through the shared prompt path. Its arguments form the
prompt title; without arguments the title is "SSH Password:". On successful,
non-empty password entry it writes only the password followed by a newline.
Cancellation, a rejected prompt, an empty password, and errors write no secret
and exit nonzero.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
Set
.B SSH_ASKPASS
 to this executable's installed path. SSH normally invokes an askpass provider
only when it has no controlling terminal; set
.B SSH_ASKPASS_REQUIRE=force
when required by the caller.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nowayprompt (1),
.BR ssh (1)
